        rdfs:comment                   "Sampler, linen embroidered with silk in variations and combinations of double running stitch and eyelets.\nThe predominant colours are blue and dark pink.  The predominant motifs are a row of blue vases with pink flowers along one of the ends and a sailing ship in the centre of one side."@en , "This sampler is the work of an experienced embroiderer who used it to record stitches, motifs and patterns for future reference.  Some of the original colours have faded."@en , "Middle East, Textile;"@en ;
